OL,3,GNEWSA'Noisy' manhole to be fixed after
OL,4,Amonths of waiting
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman's "nightmare" of living next to
OL,7,Fa "loose, noisy manhole cover" might be
OL,8,Fover after her water company promised
OL,9,Fto fix the problem.
OL,11,FRenata Czyz, whose flat backs on to
OL,12,FAshbourne Street in Shirebrook,
OL,13,FDerbyshire, said she had been unable to
OL,14,Fsleep or open her windows during the
OL,15,Fheatwaves due to traffic clattering
OL,16,Fover a square-shaped manhole.
OL,18,FDerbyshire County Council said
OL,19,Finspectors reported the defect to
OL,20,FSevern Trent "several months ago".
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
